# Pairs with AtomicAcrossCutover. A compensation runs after the commit decision
# and overturns it part way through the terminal broadcast.
MODULE: AtomicAcrossCutoverAbortAfterCommit
TARGET: AtomicAcrossCutover
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an abort overturns a recorded commit
PERTURBS: Abort

--- FIND
Abort ==
    /\ sg = "dispatch"
--- REPLACE
Abort ==
    \* MUTATION: an abort after the decision.
    /\ sg \in {"dispatch", "decided"}
--- END